# The congregation's prayer-times page is its own bundle, so /m/<slug> must
# serve masjid.html rather than the display's index.html. Both are opened by
# typing or scanning a link, not by client-side navigation, so without these
# the host 404s before any JS loads.
/m           /masjid.html   200
/m/*         /masjid.html   200
/*           /index.html    200
